ption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-10-30T16:30:27Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T07:42:12Z","closed_at":"2024-10-31T07:41:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\nReproductible in : v4.4.dev1.official [28a72fa43]\r\nNot Reproductible in : v4.3.stable\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.4.dev1.official [28a72fa43] - Any mode (compatibility/forward+/...)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nGodot editor (i.e the code editor) crashes when using global signal or global function with a parameter.\r\nThe global signal signal or function must have been declared before in a script, and this script must be global in the project parameters.  \r\n\r\nIt always happens when : \r\n- The parameter is a primitive type (int, float) or a literal string\r\nThe crash occurs immediately after the pamareter is typed. \r\n\r\nIf does not happen : \r\n- When the parameter is an Object\r\n- When the parameter is passed through a variable \r\nThus, using a intermediate variable is a workaround. \r\nMaybe something to do with the autocompletion ? \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1) Create a new project\r\n2) Create a new script 'global_signals.gd', and make it global  \r\n3) Create a function or signal with a parameter\r\n\r\n```\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nsignal test_signal(number : int)\r\n```\r\n\r\n4) Create a scene 'main.tscn' with a 'Main' node. Associate a new script to this node. \r\n5) Create a function in this script, using global signal created before : \r\n\r\n```\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nfunc test_func():\r\n    GlobalSignals.test_signal.emit(1)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen typing '1', the editor crashes. \r\nHowever, the following code will not crash:\r\n\r\n```\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nfunc test_func():\r\n    var number : int = 1\r\n    GlobalSignals.test_signal.emit(number)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[testgodot.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17575965/testgodot.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98674/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}